<title>NORWAY: Norway foreign trade surplus NOK 5.98 bln in June.</title>
<headline>Norway foreign trade surplus NOK 5.98 bln in June.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	JUNE 1997    MAY 1997   JUNE 1996</p>
<p> Imports			     19.70	 18.62	 17.50</p>
<p> Exports			     25.67	 26.87	 24.11</p>
<p> Balance				5.98	  8.25	  6.61</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		 -5.95	 -5.29	 -5.14</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
